// ── the output chunk (PERF-1): the text of the emitter and of the typing dumps is appended to ONE fixed chunk of Tp.obcap() bytes (the ob column
// of Tp.Cn, its fill in counter slot Tp.cOut()) and written with one Console.print per full chunk and one at the end (Tp.pflush); the text
// order is the order of the appends. A string longer than the chunk is written as it is, after the chunk
def Typer.obcap(): I64 = 65536
